### Forgot password — request reset PIN
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/v1/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### Verify PIN code (received via email)
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/v1/password/verify-pin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "pin_code": "123456"
}

### Reset password (after PIN verified)
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/v1/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "token": "PASTE_RESET_TOKEN_HERE",
  "new_password": "newPassword123",
  "new_password_confirmation": "newPassword123"
}

### Change password (authenticated)
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/v1/password/change
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "new_password": "newPassword123",
  "new_password_confirmation": "newPassword123"
}
